  "description": {
    "text": "The 2017 Pokémon World Championships, held from 18 to 20 August 2017 at the Anaheim Convention Center in California. Competitors got Champions Festival in eight languages, Korean being new that year, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nTrophy cards, No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer, went to the top four of each age division in both the card game and the video game championships, now in the Sun & Moon era's frame.",
